                   NOVELTY - The method involves obtaining original product                comment data. The original product comment data is                pre- processed to obtain product comment data.                Product model information is obtained for                performing named entity recognition on the product                model information to obtain a named product. A                named product is matched with the product review                information data according to a dependence                relationship between the named product and the                product comment data. A competition relationship                between products are obtained based on the matched                named product and the product review data. A                competitive network graph is established based on a                price range of the product and the competition                relationship between products. A competition                relationship between products is analyzed based on                the competitive network graph.
