                    ADVANTAGE - The system realizes an ensemble pipeline                improves accuracy and performance better than                single model for complex and noisy sentence case                problems, and improved automated sentence-case                correction helps maintaining consistent, and                professional-looking content at scale without                relying solely on manual review. The ensemble                pipeline is robust to stop words and special                characters, and automatically generate                sentence-case correction suggestion for users. The                proper formatting and presentation of advertisement                copy, product descriptions, and other marketing                text, help with effectively engaging customers and                maintaining brand consistency.
