TI  - Method for evaluating initial electronic documents            to identify document content categories for portions of            content within electronic documents, involves            recreating initial documents according to privacy            information redactions
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves applying a pre-determined                machine learning model for a financial business                domain category to a header portion of a particular                electronic document. A probability value is                determined through applying the model for the                domain category. A determination is made whether                the content in the header portion is considered to                be financial privacy information. The initial                documents are recreated according to privacy                information redactions at respective locations of                the respective portions of content. A version of                the particular document is generated to include a                visual modification at a document position of                header portion. The modification obscures the                content indicative of the domain.
                    USE - Method for evaluating initial electronic                documents to identify document content categories                for portions of content within electronic                documents.
                    ADVANTAGE - The privacy engine provides a customizable                solution that improves the accuracy of privacy                information detection while still allowing for                human activity in a privacy engine feedback loop to                review/approve the redacted content and to further                train the privacy engine based on detected privacy                information and the review or approval activity of                one or more human reviewers by leveraging multiple                natural language processing (NLP) models, named                entity recognition models and others machine                learning techniques to recognize privacy                information included within unstructured                content.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are included for the                following:(1) a system for evaluating initial electronic                documents to identify document content categories                for portions of content within electronic                documents;(2) a computer program product for evaluating                initial electronic documents to identify document                content categories for portions of content within                electronic documents.
