TI  - Method for providing serverless            data-representation-as-a-service for enabling building            of general input data machine learning flows for e.g.            text classification, by using computing device e.g.            desktop computer systems, involves generating set of            data representations by generator based on input            data
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method (600) involves receiving (610) a                first data representation (DR) generation request                from a first calling entity. First input data is                retrieved (620) based on the first DR generation                request in response to receiving the first DR                generation request. A first set of data                representations is generated (630) by a DR                generator based on the first input data. A second                DR generation request is received from a second                calling entity. The first set of data                representations is made (640) available to the                first calling entity. Second input data is                retrieved based on the second DR generation                request. A second set of data representations is                generated by the DR generator based on the second                input data. The second set of data representations                is made available to the second calling                entity.
                    USE - Method for providing serverless                data-representation-as-a-service (DRaaS) for                enabling building of general input data machine                learning (ML) flows for general use cases by using                a computing device. Uses include but are not                limited to desktop computer systems, portable                computer systems, handheld devices, and networking                devices, and use cases such as sentiment analysis                of the customer reviews, text classification,                keyword detection, language detection, named entity                recognition, and personal identifying information                (PII) detection.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method enables effectively lowering the                skill level required to generate and maintain ML                workflows that operate on data representations of                data objects, and improving computer-related                technology by providing a DRaaS service for various                input modalities. The method enables providing data                representations of customer reviews so as to allow                data scientists to quickly customize for a fake                review detection use case. The method enables                improving the overall quality of the joint data                representation by providing fine outcome labels and                re-training the model.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is included for a                non-transitory storage media storing instructions                for providing serverless DRaaS for enabling                building of general input data ML flows.
