TI  - Unstructured data analysis based system for            recommending form field extension used in different            fields, comprises data ingestion unit that is            configured to receive unstructured data from different            sources providing text documents, emails, and web            pages
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system comprises data ingestion unit that                is configured to receive unstructured data from                different sources providing text documents, emails,                and web pages. A processing unit provides a Natural                Language Processing (NLP) engine that is configured                to perform syntactic and semantic analysis of the                received unstructured data. The NLP engine uses                tokenization, part of speech tagging, and Named                Entity Recognition (NER) techniques to extract                meaningful entities and relationships from the                unstructured text. A Machine Learning (ML) based                control unit is operatively connected to the                processing unit. The ML model is trained on a                diverse dataset to recognize patterns and                associations between different types of entities                and form fields. The ML model uses supervised                learning techniques to predict appropriate form                fields to capture each extracted entity. A form                field expansion unit is connected to the ML                model.
                    USE - Unstructured data analysis based system for                recommending a form field extension used in                different fields, such as medical records, legal                documents, and financial transactions.
                    ADVANTAGE - The system improves the accuracy and                completeness of data capture by dynamically                adapting form layouts and suggesting new fields                based on the extracted information. The quality of                the captured data is improved. The user experience                and efficiency are improved by presenting                recommendations through an intuitive user                interface, allowing users to review and customize                suggestions based on their preferences and                domain-specific knowledge. The system identify key                entities and determine the appropriate form fields                to capture each entity through contextual                understanding and semantic analysis.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a block diagram of the                unstructured data analysis based system for                recommending a form field extension used in                different fields.100System102Data ingestion unit104Processing unit106Control unit108Form field expansion unit110User interface
