TI  - Artificial intelligence based personalized hotel,            tour, cultural trip and holiday recommendation and            pricing system has module that makes dynamic pricing            and price comparisons using gradient boosting machines            (GBM) and random forest algorithms
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system has a module that collects data                from tour, cultural trip and hotel sites using web                scraping and web automation algorithms. Module                learns user preferences using collaborative                filtering, content-based filtering and K-means                clustering algorithms. Module learns users vacation                times using long short-term memory (LSTM) RNNs and                time series analysis algorithms. The module makes                written and voice notifications using                text-to-speech (TTS) and natural language                generation (NLG) algorithms. A module processes                voice commands using automatic speech recognition                (ASR), natural language processing (NLP) and named                entity recognition (NER) algorithms. The module                presents visual and video content using image                retrieval and video summarization algorithms. The                module makes dynamic pricing and price comparisons                using gradient boosting machines (GBM) and random                forest algorithms. The module performs energy and                resource management using quantization, edge                computing and transfer learning algorithms.
                    USE - Artificial intelligence based personalized                hotel, tour, cultural trip and holiday                recommendation and pricing system.
                    ADVANTAGE - The holiday planning process is made more                effective, efficient and user-friendly. The system                provides efficient operation on mobile devices by                optimizing the system performance. The automation                system improves user experience, reduces manual                errors, and saves time. The user interface enhances                interaction by providing intuitive platform and                allows users to enter their preferences, access                personalized recommendations, review itinerary                suggestions, and make choices that suit the travel                desires. The system improves the user experience by                optimizing the accommodation and trip choices of                users such as hotels, tours and cultural trips. The                system ensures the efficient operation of the                system and reduces energy consumption, thus                effectively managing the battery life and                processing power of smartphones.
