AB  - With the rapid development of Mongolian information technology and the closer communication within different nationalities, machine translation between Mongolian language and Chinese becomes more and more important. Traditional Mongolian-Chinese machine translation has achieved fruitful results in recent years but also confronts with many challenges. This paper reviews the recent development of Traditional Mongolian-Chinese machine translation, including the translation model, corpus collection and proofreading, traditional Mongolian code conversion, lemmatization, named entity recognition, parsing and system combination, etc. We also introduce our group's research and achievement in Traditional Mongolian-Chinese machine translation.
