TI  - Cross-Lingual Transfer Learning in Drug-Related Information Extraction from User-Generated Texts
T2  - PROGRAMMING AND COMPUTER SOFTWARE
M3  - Article
M3  - Proceedings Paper
CP  - Proceedings of the Institute for System Programming of the RAS (ISP RAS)
