TI  - ML based Method for extracting relevant            information from data sources from e-receipts            indicative of product purchase, involves determining            set of predicted values for set of defined categories,            and set of distinct groups created using entity Linking            model, a digital reward for product's purchase
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves initially training a                machine learning model by a processor using a                masked language modeling task and a set of training                data, where the training data comprises training                electronic communications (300) labeled with                training designated HyperText Markup Language                (HTML) tags that define how content included in the                communications is displayed. The model is trained                using a named entity recognition task and                task-specific training dataset. A series of input                tokens is generated by the processor, and                converting token-level prediction into a predicted                value for a defined category of a set of defined                categories associated with the purchase of the                product or service by the individual. A digital                reward for the purchase of the product or service                by the individual is determined based on a set                predicted values for the defined categories and                distinct groups created using an entity linking                model.
                    USE - Machine learning (ML) based Method for                extracting relevant information from digital                sources, i.e data sources from scanned paper                documents, i.e electronic communications, such as                e-receipts, emails, PDF files, or images captured                by a digital camera indicative of product/service                purchases.
                    ADVANTAGE - The HTML supports rich formatting that enables                different fonts, colors, and styles, as well as the                embedding of images, tables, lists, and links, thus                HTML enables the sender to control the layout of                the email, which may be particularly important for                marketing and transactional emails where                presentation and branding can greatly influence the                perception and response by the recipient. The use                of server computer may enable the individuals to                review the results of the machine learning analysis                by electronic devices to improve the prediction                capabilities of the machine learning model, and may                result in improved accuracy and consistency across                different retailers, and formats. The method can                retrain the machine learning model using output                data, which improves the accuracy and efficiency of                subsequent analyses. directly access and analyze                electronic communications (e.g., emails), instead                of first converting electronic communications into                images and processing the images. The method                processes the electronic communications in certain                formats, e.g HTML to provide results in real-time                or near-real-time, thus reduces processing                resources, decrease processing time, and decrease                bandwidth requirements.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are included for: (1) a ML                based system for extracting relevant information                from data sources from e-receipts indicative of                product purchase; (2) a non-transitory                computer-readable storage medium.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a schematic representation                of data processing in Machine learning (ML) based                Method.300electronic communication indicating an                e-receipt for a product order301retailer303order details304product details305cost details
